# The Ornithopter's granted "{3}, {T}, Sacrifice Deconstruction Hammer" is paid with Mox Pearl, Mox Jet and Krark-Clan
# Ironworks' "Sacrifice an artifact: Add {C}{C}" sacrificing the Hammer itself. Once the mana is paid the Hammer is gone
# (CR 400.7), so its sacrifice can't be paid (CR 601.2g-h by way of 602.2b, 118.3): the activation is taken back with its
# mana abilities (CR 733.1). Nothing goes on the stack, the Hammer is on the battlefield untapped, the Ornithopter is not
# tapped and Bot2's Sol Ring is not destroyed.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Krark-Clan Ironworks
Ornithopter
Deconstruction Hammer
Black Lotus
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Sol Ring
Island x18

